OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGirl group Katseye are missing two
OL,4,Amembers, but their tour still dazzles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stage felt emptier without them,
OL,7,Fbut their bandmates worked hard to fill
OL,8,Fthe gaps, hyping up the crowd with a
OL,9,Fsuccession of bass-heavy pop anthems
OL,10,Fand jaw-dropping dance breaks.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
